#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Bounded trust boundary and process supervisor for LocalWrap.

The QML shell never parses repository-owned files directly and never launches
manifest commands directly. This helper bounds input before JSON decoding,
resolves containment on disk, builds a review fingerprint for the exact launch,
and owns a dedicated process group for every confirmed dev server.
"""

